OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickens and lowers from the west with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain following, locally
OL,8,Fheavy through the early hours before
OL,9,Fclearing most the country by dawn.
OL,10,FTurning breezy and remaining mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly cloud and rain clear
OL,13,Fto the southeast with a mostly dry day
OL,14,Fwith plenty of sunny spells then
OL,15,Ffollowing. The odd shower possible
OL,16,Ftowards northern and western coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
