OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFurther
OL,6,Fwet weather arriving by the afternoon
OL,7,Fon Friday. Mostly cloudy on Saturday
OL,8,Fand Sunday with patchy rain and
OL,9,Fstronger winds. Brighter to the east
OL,10,Fof high ground.
